  {
   "id": "cb_9216dc5a790b0fc0aa07429f",
   "order": 6,
   "title_en": "Carbon Fiber Surface",
   "body_en": "The Carbon Fiber has a very slight texture similar to real Carbon Fiber. The pattern transfers to the first layer of the 3D printed model, creating a 3D effect with a distinctive texture, especially when used with a gray carbon filament color.",
